        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;<i>There’s no way out when the monsters are within</i>&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scars of the past are tearing open, bringing forth disturbing manifestations that will prey on your sanity until they consume you in <strong>Darko</strong>, a short psychological horror game developed by Psicostudios. Step into the role of Alex, a young man trapped in his own mind as a <strong>psychotic episode</strong> unfolds inside his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After waking from a heavy nap, <strong>Alex</strong> panics when he realizes he forgot to take his schizophrenia medication. As he searches the house for his pills, terrifying visions from his past materialize, pursuing him relentlessly. <strong>If they catch him, it’s over</strong>. To survive, Alex must recover his medication and uncover the haunting truth behind his memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival-focused</strong> gameplay: you cannot fight back, only evade and stay calm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive <strong>retro-inspired 3D visuals</strong> with an unsettling, abstract atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the house for <strong>medication</strong> while piecing together fragments of Alex’s troubled past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unscripted</strong> scares: the monsters that hunt you can appear at any moment, creating truly unpredictable horror.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;<i>There’s no way out when the monsters are within</i>&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scars of the past are tearing open, bringing forth disturbing manifestations that will prey on your sanity until they consume you in <strong>Darko</strong>, a short psychological horror game developed by Psicostudios. Step into the role of Alex, a young man trapped in his own mind as a <strong>psychotic episode</strong> unfolds inside his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After waking from a heavy nap, <strong>Alex</strong> panics when he realizes he forgot to take his schizophrenia medication. As he searches the house for his pills, terrifying visions from his past materialize, pursuing him relentlessly. <strong>If they catch him, it’s over</strong>. To survive, Alex must recover his medication and uncover the haunting truth behind his memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival-focused</strong> gameplay: you cannot fight back, only evade and stay calm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive <strong>retro-inspired 3D visuals</strong> with an unsettling, abstract atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the house for <strong>medication</strong> while piecing together fragments of Alex’s troubled past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unscripted</strong> scares: the monsters that hunt you can appear at any moment, creating truly unpredictable horror.</p></li></ul>",
